 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "emerald",
   "title": "Recipient gating",
   "items": [
    "Email goes out when the recipient belongs to the entity or their investor_access has email_enabled; WhatsApp additionally needs the entity permission, the access flag, and the recipient's own opt-in",
    "A blank CustomNotification body skips the channel \u2014 SkippedNotificationReportJob reports what was skipped",
    "WhatsApp delivery is hard-disabled in the test environment; email is captured by the :test adapter"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "violet",
   "title": "Templates",
   "items": [
    "CustomNotification is scoped per entity + email_method with enabled/latest flags; whatsapp text capped at 255 chars and sanitized before sending",
    "Each notifier supplies mailer_name, email_method, and email_data; mailers render under ApplicationMailer with the email date format forced to Mon dd, yyyy"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "Throttling & bounces",
   "items": [
    "config.wait = email_delay randomizes 1..entity_setting.email_delay_seconds (default up to 300s) so sends don't flood SES",
    "ApplicationMailer's tag_for_bounce_tracking sets X-SES-CONFIGURATION-SET and a tracking header on notifier-driven sends",
    "SES publishes bounces/complaints to SNS; ProcessSesNotificationJob parses the envelope and ties the result back to the Noticed::Notification (email_deliverability pack)"
   ]
  }
 ]
}